@startuml journey-dev-coverage
' ============================================================
' Developer View: End-to-End Journey x Automated Test Coverage
'
' Same journey backbone as journey-end-to-end, recolored by test coverage so
' the diagram doubles as a Playwright/e2e gap map.
'
'   GREEN  = exercised end-to-end by a Playwright spec (frontend/e2e/*.spec.ts)
'   AMBER  = built, but only unit/component tested (frontend/src/**/*.test.tsx)
'            -> the remaining e2e backlog
'   RED    = no automated test (mostly planned / not-yet-built steps)
'   GREY   = backend work, covered by pytest, out of frontend-e2e scope
'
' Coverage sources (frontend/e2e/*.spec.ts, current set):
'   reader, reader-conflict, reader-reload-resume, library, intake,
'   guardian-auth, guardian-console, guardian-review, guardian-profiles,
'   guardian-books, assignments, profiles, story-requests,
'   story-requests-kid, story-requests-authored, series-continue, landing,
'   admin-user-management (#267), authoring-queue (#268), device-authorization,
'   moderation, provider-allowlist, a11y, visual, and e2e/naive-user/*
'   Added 2026-07-23 to 2026-07-27 (backfill + Task A7/A12 mobile-web
'   readiness; see below for per-node mapping):
'     admin-read-heavy, guardian-connections, guardian-consent,
'     guardian-password-reset, review-edit (2026-07-23); cross-device,
'     responsive (2026-07-24); admin-touch-targets, mobile-viewport
'     (2026-07-25); keyboard-nav, kid-touch-targets (2026-07-27)
'   frontend/e2e-real/{approval-flow,authored-request,kid-reads,
'     naive-kid-misuse-real,series-continue-real,authoring-plan-real,
'     moderation-real,ratings-real}.spec.ts  (real-backend smoke, zero mocks)
'   frontend/e2e-prod/ and frontend/e2e-staging/ (deployed-env smoke, own configs)
'   frontend/src/**/*.test.ts(x)  (Vitest component + unit)
'
'   Inventoried 2026-08-14, NOT yet mapped to backbone nodes (10 specs the
'   lists above had never picked up):
'     admin-audit, admin-review-cover, guardian-devices,
'     guardian-notifications, guardian-preview-as-child, guardian-privacy,
'     guardian-reading, kid-read-aloud, reader-flag, reader-go-back
'   Most of these exercise guardian- and admin-console pages that this
'   child-initiated backbone does not contain, so they would not recolour a
'   node even once mapped; the reader three reinforce a node already green.
'   That is a name-level read, NOT a per-node audit, which is why they are
'   listed separately rather than merged into the verified sets above.
'
' Coverage classification last verified: 2026-08-04 for the node COLOURS
' (re-audited the eleven specs added 2026-07-23 to 2026-07-27 against this
' backbone; see per-node notes and the legend's "Not yet recolored" entry for
' what changed and what did not). The spec INVENTORY above was refreshed
' 2026-08-14 against the 45 files then in frontend/e2e/, which is how the ten
' unmapped specs surfaced. Treat the colours as a 2026-08-04 snapshot: this
' diagram bakes a claim into a committed artifact, so a stale green reads as
' reassurance rather than as an omission.
' ============================================================

